*CMOS Inverter - DC sweep (VTC)
.lib /foss/pdks/sky130A/libs.tech/ngspice/sky130.lib.spice tt

Vdd vdd 0 1.8
Vin in 0 0 


XM1 out in vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 W=2 L=0.15
XM2 out in 0 0 sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 W=1 L=0.15

.control
dc Vin 0 1.8 0.01 
plot v(out) vs v(in)
write ../data/inverter_vtc.raw
.endc
.end
